    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_beats",
      "narration": "Its wings beat up to about eighty times a second, so fast that they hum.",
      "on_screen_text": "Up to 80 beats a second",
      "highlight_words": [
        "80"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_eight",
      "narration": "But the trick is how it moves them: the wingtip traces a figure eight in the air.",
      "on_screen_text": "A figure-eight wingbeat",
      "highlight_words": [
        "figure-eight"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_lift",
      "narration": "That way it pushes air down when the wing goes down, and also when it comes up, something almost no other bird does.",
      "on_screen_text": "Pushing down and up",
      "highlight_words": [
        "up"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_hover",
      "narration": "That's why it can hover in one spot, like a tiny helicopter.",
      "on_screen_text": "Like a helicopter",
      "highlight_words": [
        "helicopter"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_back",
      "narration": "It can even fly backward, something almost no other bird can manage.",
      "on_screen_text": "It flies backward!",
      "highlight_words": [
        "backward!"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_heart",
      "narration": "To pull it off, its heart can beat more than twelve hundred times a minute.",
      "on_screen_text": "1,200 beats a minute",
      "highlight_words": [
        "1,200"
      ],
      "sfx": "impact",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "col_torpor",
      "narration": "It burns so much energy that at night it falls into a deep sleep and lowers its body temperature to save fuel.",
      "on_screen_text": "At night: power-saving mode",
      "highlight_words": [
        "power-saving"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
